{
  "about": "Corrections to Tools/add_hero.py's guesses, by hero body name. Paragon names most clips after the hero's own abilities (Gideon's Cosmic_Rift, Burden...), which no guess by name can place, so each hero's are chosen here from its Animations folder and checked on film (Tools\\AnimCatalog.bat). Clip names are the asset names in the hero's folder. A role given here replaces the guess; a motion given here replaces that motion only. Paragon's HitReact_* and some heroes' gun shots are additive, made to be layered, so a hit plays the hero's full-body knockback as Sparrow's does.",
